Description: zink: no pipeline statistics pool without pipelineStatisticsQuery
 Without VK_EXT_primitives_generated_query, or for a non-zero stream without
 primitivesGeneratedQueryWithNonZeroStreams, zink emulates
 PIPE_QUERY_PRIMITIVES_GENERATED with a VK_QUERY_TYPE_PIPELINE_STATISTICS pool
 (zink_query.c, convert_query_type() and zink_create_query()). It did not
 check the pipelineStatisticsQuery feature. Vulkan forbids such a pool when
 the feature is not enabled (VkQueryPoolCreateInfo valid usage), so on a
 driver without it the pool creation is undefined behaviour; pvr reaches
 UNREACHABLE in pvr_query_pool_setup().
 .
 Fail the query creation in that case, as zink already gates
 PIPE_QUERY_PIPELINE_STATISTICS_SINGLE on the feature (zink_screen.c,
 query_pipeline_statistics_single).
 .
 Only for this downstream stack; not intended for upstream submission.
